<import src="../../templates/api-state.wxml"/><view class="page api-page"><template is="api-state" data="{{loading,error,needsLogin}}"/><view wx:if="{{availability}}" class="card col gap-md"><text class="headline-sm">确认预约</text><text>{{availability.slot.slotDate}} {{availability.slot.startTime}} — {{availability.slot.endTime}}</text><text>座位 / 名额：{{seatNo === 0 ? '整间 / 整台' : seatNo}}</text><text class="body-sm muted">请按时到场，并通过学校现场提供的凭证签到。申请可能需要校方审核。</text><checkbox-group bindchange="toggleAgree"><label class="row gap-sm"><checkbox value="agree" checked="{{isAgreed}}"/><text>我已阅读并同意按时履约</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || submitted || !availability.canReserve}}">提交预约申请</button></view></view>
